   9: 
  10:   /// Optional migration registry applied during [decode] to lift older
  11:   /// schema versions up to the current one before inflating the model.
  12:   /// `null` (default) means documents are decoded as-is — callers loading
  13:   /// legacy data should pass a registry with the relevant steps registered.
