**Decoding Titles**

Alright, I’ve got the title as a decoded string, which is good! Now, I’m thinking it might be useful to decode both the title and the data-title as well. That could be the right move! I’ll call that our patch. It seems like a straightforward approach to ensure everything is in the expected format. Let’s see how that goes!
